From: obig20 <obig20@example.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:30:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/18] Add gamepad mapping and analog stick maths

radialDeadzone rescales so there is no jump at the deadzone edge; readPad maps the
standard layout (A jump, X/RT/RB pulse, Y restart, Start pause) and tolerates odd
controllers. PadEdges turns held buttons into per-frame presses. 16 new tests.

Co-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
